 "id": 1835900,
 "titulo": "4/15 Patch Details (Completed)",
 "fecha": 1744700489268,
 "modificada": 1745915321684,
 "url": "https://forum.netmarble.com/futurefight_en/view/2196/1835900",
 "html": "<p><img alt=\"\" id=\"1744681947443\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/b66b19e2792a4226a58103794214f148_1744681947443_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Greetings, Agents.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">This is CM Fragment of MARVEL Future Fight.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">The mercenary assassin has received her call<br>\nand stood up once again with her Sai!</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\">Tier-4</span> and a&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\">new Uniform</span>&nbsp;have&nbsp;been added to <span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\">Elektra</span><br>\nwho is now ready to take down her target.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Agents, check out the new skills and power of the updated hero<br>\nby downloading the 4/15 Patch!</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">■ 4/15 Patch Details</span></strong></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Patch Schedule: 4/16 (Wed) 3:00 (UTC+0), 4/15 (Tue) 20:00 (PDT)</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\">[4/16 (Wed) 2:56 (UTC+0), 4/16 (Wed) 19:56 (PDT) added]</span><br>\nThe patch has been completed as of 4/16 (Wed) 2:54 (UTC+0), 4/16 (Wed) 19:54 (PDT).<br>\nPlease reconnect to the game and download the patch file.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">* The patch completion time may be changed depending on the circumstances.</span></span></span><br>\n<span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Completion time will be announced once the patch has been completed.</span></span></span><br>\n<span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">* The patch will be applied in waves, and the application time may vary by Agent.<br>\n* The game can still be accessed during the patch.<br>\nWhen the patch is complete, please restart and apply the patch for better service.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><strong>▣ One New Uniform</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">The new Uniform Elektra &lt;Elektra&gt; has been added.<br>\n<span style=\"color:#ff0099;\">* The skill effects of the Uniform are based on the maximum skill level stats.<br>\n* The new Uniform&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\">will be on sale for 50% off during the &lt;Elektra Update Celebration Event&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\">&nbsp;<br>\nand can be checked and purchased in the Marvel Universe and Uniform Room after the Event.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"1561\" id=\"1744682068644\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/a631b71e252a4df6aff8322ad93e1bcb_1744682068644_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">▣ Elektra Tier-4</span></strong></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Tier 4 Advancement has been added to Elektra.<br>\nThis will sharpen her deadly Sai so Elektra can remove her targets quickly.<br>\n<span style=\"color:#ff0099;\">* The Tier-4 Striker Skill effects are based on Lv.6 stats.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"267\" id=\"1744682094430\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/06547934689d41ff82e6b33c5b644374_1744682094430_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><strong>▣ Game Error Fixes</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">1. The chat log link that appears when acquiring Odin’s Blessings&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">from the Zombie Survival store being linked to the Dimension Chest store has been fixed.</span></span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">We look forward to your active participation in the events&nbsp;<br>\nthat will be held to support the growth of the updated heroes.</span></span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Thank you.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1744681894315\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/82573a5d96ec465c86be15224ba83bd4_1744681894315_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></span></span></p>\n"
